From: yapixel <yapixel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 05:49:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] SUSFS de-inlined hooks for kernel-3.10

---
 fs/Makefile            |    1 
 fs/ioprio.c            |   12 ++
 fs/namei.c             |   71 ++++++++++++-
 fs/namespace.c         |  264 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 fs/notify/fdinfo.c     |   26 +++++
 fs/proc/base.c         |   30 +++++
 fs/proc/cmdline.c      |   12 ++
 fs/proc/fd.c           |   75 ++++++++++++++
 fs/proc/task_mmu.c     |   91 +++++++++++++++++
 fs/proc_namespace.c    |   51 +++++++++
 fs/readdir.c           |  113 +++++++++++++++++++++
 fs/stat.c              |   50 +++++++++
 fs/statfs.c            |   79 ++++++++++++++
 fs/super.c             |   25 +++++
